      "narrative": {
        "text": "Figure 1 — Overview diagram of WireGen: at left a cartoon designer at a drawing tablet with a thought cloud reading \"How to design a recipe page in food app?\" (labelled \"Design Intent\"); a \"Prompt\" arrow leads to a central block where a stack of UI screenshots is used for \"Fine-tuning\" a grey \"Large Language Models\" bar into a colourful \"Fine-tuned Large Language Models\" box with a \"UI-specific\" flowchart icon (labelled \"WireGen\"); a \"Beautify\" arrow leads to an illustration of a phone with gear, ruler and compass under \"Design Guidelines & UI Rules\", and an \"Output\" arrow leads to stacked grey mobile wireframes of a \"FOODS / Top recipe picks\" screen with image tiles (Eggless Desserts, Condiment Special, Indo-Chinese, Sweet Tooth), labelled \"Mid-Fidelity Wireframes\".",
        "state": "draft",
        "drafted_by": {
