      "narrative": {
        "text": "Figure 3 — Three-phase pipeline diagram. \"Data Preparation (Sec 3.1)\": Rico UI screens (a dark settings screen) are converted into \"UI-specific language\" as HTML code and a style sheet, paired with a Screen2Words description (\"settings page to enable options and notification\"). \"Model Fine-tuning (Sec 3.2)\": icons for training data selection, model selection and hyperparameter configuration feed fine-tuning of a transformer block (masked multi self attention, layer normalization, feed forward, layer normalization) labelled \"Large Language Models\". \"Output Beautification (Sec 3.3)\": a phone illustration surrounded by clouds reading \"Add semantic icons\", \"Adjust text typography\" and \"Follow UI guidelines\".",
        "state": "draft",
        "drafted_by": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "not-disclosed",
          "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01TA4id51RCSxZ4NxijDwrWQ"
